{
  "id": "NUM.35",
  "number": "35",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Orubara 35",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "35",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "35",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akagambira Musa omu mpita za Moabu haihi na Yorudani ahalebangaine na Yeriko ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oragire Abaisiraeli omu butaka bwabo bahemu Abalevita ebigo by'okuturamu. Kandi babahe n'amataka agataine ebigo ebyo balisizemu ebitunganwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigo ebyo bibe byabo by'okuturamu, n'amalisizo gabe g'ente zabo n'ebitunganwa byabo byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amalisizo ag'aha bigo ago muliha Abalevita, gatandikire aha boma z'ebigo gagende emita 450 buli bwolekera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enjai y'ekigo rubaju orw'oburugaizoba mupime emita 900; kasi emita 900; obugwaizoba emita 900; na bikara emita 900, ekigo kisigare omugati. Ago gabe nigo gaba malisizo gabo aha bigo byabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalevita mulibaha ebigo mukaga eby'abantu kuhungiramu. Wena aliita omuntu ahungire omwo, kandi ebigo ebyo mukaga mubongereho makumi 42. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Byona hamoi mulibaha ebigo makumi 48, hamoi n'amalisizo agabyataine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigo ebyo muliihya muliihya aha butaka bw'Abaisiraeli kuha Abalevita, abangi mulibaihyaho bingi, n'abake mulibaihyaho bike. Buli ruganda n'obusika bwarwo okwo buliba buli, nikwo rulihiraho Abalevita aha bigo byarwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akagambira Musa ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ogambire Abaisiraeli oti, Orwo mulishabuka Yorudani mukagya omu nsi ya Kanaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho mulironda ebigo byanyu eby'okuhungiramu. Alishangwa aisire omuntu atagendeleire abe nimwo ahungira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigo ebyo bilibabera buhungiro bw'okukiliramu aha muntu ow'enzigu alikwenda kwehora. Aliba aisire omuntu aleke kufa atakemeleire mu maisho ga bakuru omushangogwe kuramurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ebigo ebyo omukaga ebyo muliha Abalevita nibyo biliba byanyu by'okuhungiramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buseli bwa Yorudani mwihyeyo bishatu, n'ebindi bishatu omuli Kanaani. Ebyo biliba bigo by'okuhungiramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigo ebyo mukaga biliba buhungiro bw'Abaisiraeli n'abanyamahanga n'abaliba bafurukiiremu. Aliita omuntu atamugendeleire, ahungiremu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nawe k'halimuteza ekikwato ky'ekyoma akafa, ogwo aliba ali mwisi, kandi omwisi ogwo bamwite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara k'alikwata eibare ely'okwita omuntu, akhalimuteza akafa, ogwo aliba ali mwisi, mara omwisi bamwite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Handiki akwate ekiti eky'okwita omuntu akimuteze afe, ogwo aliba ali mwisi, omwisi bamwite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu alyeholera owa wenene owo baisire, aliba amwisire amwite; k'halimutanganwa amwite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi aisire omuntu k'aliba amuchumisire omuhyo aha rw'okumunoba, anga akamuchokera, handiki kumuzimbira, akafa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anga aha rw'okumunoba akamutera enkoni akamunaga ahansi, akafa, kimutera ogwo bamwite; aliba ali mwisi. Alikweholera kifa k'alitanganwa omwisi ogwo, amwite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai k'halimutera omuhyo kibandagara atalikumunoba, anga akagira ekyo yamujugunyira atamuzimbiire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anga akamuteza eibare ely'okwita omuntu atamuboine, akafa, n'orwo babaire batalikunobangana, kugir'oti yamugendelera kumuhutaza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho embaga eramure omushango gwa kiita n'alikweholera kifa, okwo emigenzo elikuragira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embaga egyo ekize kiita ahali olinya alikweholera kiitwa atamwita, emugarure omu kigo ky'okuhungiramu ekyo abaire ahungiremu, akikaremu kuhika orwo Omukuhani Nyamukuru ayakozirwe amajuta gatakatifu alifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai kiitamuntu k'alilenga kushabuka orubibi rw'ekigo ekyo ahungiremu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alikweholera kiitwa akamushanga enjai y'ekigo ekyo ekyo ahungiiremu akamwita, talikwatwa mushango ogwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okuba kiitamuntu naragirwa kwikara omu kigokye ky'obuhungiro kuhika aha kufa kw'Omukuhani Nyamukuru muno, aho abe nirwo agaruka omuka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ebiragiro ebi n'emigenzo egi mubikwate oburora bwanyu bwona hona hona mbali mulikatura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaishe muntu aliita ondijo, kugya kumwita hazokweho buzima abajulizi babili. Kyonkai ataliitwa hazokire omujulizi omoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mutalitora kya kuchungura muntu aisire ondijo kandi okwo naragirwa kwitwa. Owab'ogwo bamwite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mutalikiliza eky'okuchungura omuntu ahungiire omu kigo ky'okuhungiramu, k'agaruka omuka kandi okwo Omukuhani Nyamukuru muno atakafire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
